{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55903","headline":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 六十 · 居遁","name":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 六十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人天须假像行持，无像无形世岂知？\n空生体得岩中坐，华雨由来责见迟。\n三乘欲学如斯事，直似空生方始知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"居遁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55903.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55903","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}